  new List<String>{'rck-car-perf-3-2','RC: Tuning shocks for a bumpy track (entry-level RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Performance & Tuning: tuning shocks for a bumpy track. Step-by-step guidance for entry-level models.','<h2>Tuning shocks for a bumpy track</h2><p>Applies to entry-level RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Performance &amp; Tuning.</p><ol><li>Use lighter oil and softer springs for rough surfaces.</li><li>Set ride height evenly side to side.</li><li>Bleed shocks so both sides match.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Performance & Tuning'},
